        "text": "**Developing the Code**\n\nI've crafted `filter_metric_dimensions.py` leveraging Google Cloud Monitoring. The code clearly identifies its provider (`google.cloud.monitoring_v3`) and includes comments to assist with replacing placeholder values such as `your-gcp-project`.\n\n\n**Coding the Script**\n\nI've finalized the `filter_metric_dimensions.py` script, employing Google Cloud Monitoring. The code explicitly signals its provider with `google.cloud.monitoring_v3`. User guidance is baked in: the code includes comments to explain placeholder modification like `your-gcp-project-id` and filter adjustments.\n\n\n",
