        "text": "**Developing Metric Retrieval**\n\nI've crafted `aggregate_metric_stats.py`, leveraging the Datadog API as requested. It's got the necessary imports for provider identification. The main function, `get_aggregated_metric_stats`, is ready for use, accepting a metric name and start timestamp. It seems to be working, I think.\n\n\n**Confirming Task Completion**\n\nI've finished `aggregate_metric_stats.py`, which is implemented with Datadog's API, and am checking the environmental variables required for authentication. My code includes the necessary import for datadog_api_client, and the `get_aggregated_metric_stats` function which receives the metric name, start time, end time, and optional interval. I've also incorporated a basic usage example.\n\n\n",
